## Original Content
Uma das mais celebradas cantoras dos EUA, voz de "Jolene" e "9 to 5", Parton tinha admitido recentemente estar a padecer de problemas de saúde, mas que ainda tinha "muitas coisas por alcançar".

## Summary
Dolly Parton, a 80-year-old iconic American country music singer known for hits like 'Jolene' and '9 to 5', has passed away after recently acknowledging health issues but expressing her desire to achieve more.

